# Build-context exclusions (P-5.8).
#
# ⚠️ `.env` first, and it is not a size optimisation. The root `.env` holds the development JWT
# secret and credential-encryption key; a `COPY . .` that swept it into a production image would
# ship those keys to whoever can pull it — and `loadDotEnv()` walks up from cwd, so the file would
# also be *read*, silently overriding the orchestrator's real environment with dev values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite

# Review artefacts, screenshots and harnesses — large, and none of it runs in production.
docs/review/**/screenshots
.data
